{"title": "Corpse Crawler", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt\" id=\"druid-container-1\"><div><div class=\"druid-title\">Corpse Crawler</div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div class=\"druid-main-image\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-labels druid-tabs\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In-Game\">In-Game</div></div><a href=\"/wiki/File:CorpseCrawler.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"CorpseCrawler.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/CorpseCrawler.jpg/250px-CorpseCrawler.jpg?cf2ea0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/CorpseCrawler.jpg/375px-CorpseCrawler.jpg?cf2ea0 1.5x, /images/thumb/CorpseCrawler.jpg/500px-CorpseCrawler.jpg?cf2ea0 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Information\">Information</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-VariantOf\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-VariantOf\">Variant Of</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-VariantOf druid-data-nonempty\">\nSpore Lizard</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InternalID\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InternalID\">Internal ID</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InternalID druid-data-nonempty\">\nCorpseCrawlerEnemy</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaxCount\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaxCount\">Max Count</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaxCount druid-data-nonempty\">\n2</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-PowerLevel\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-PowerLevel\">Power Level</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-PowerLevel druid-data-nonempty\">\n1</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-CauseofDeath\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-CauseofDeath\">Cause of Death</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-CauseofDeath druid-data-nonempty\">\nMauling, Stabbing</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-IsBodyRecoverable\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-IsBodyRecoverable\">Is Body Recoverable?</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-IsBodyRecoverable druid-data-nonempty\">\nYes</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Stats\">Stats</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Health\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Health\">Health</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Health druid-data-nonempty\">\nUnkillable</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Damage\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Damage\">Damage</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Damage druid-data-nonempty\">\n20</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DoorSpeedMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DoorSpeedMultiplier\">Door Speed Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DoorSpeedMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n0.3</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-StunTimeMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-StunTimeMultiplier\">Stun Time Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-StunTimeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n0.6</div></div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Corpse Crawler</b> is a relatively passive entity and variant of the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Spore_Lizard\">Spore Lizard</a>. It is an employee's corpse stuffed with machinery, being riddled with spikes protruding out of the employee's body. It additionally has four hydraulic legs, a mechanical spine, and a pale baby head with hollowed out eyes.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Mechanics\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Mechanics\">&gt; Mechanics</span></h2>\n<p>Similar to the Spore Lizard, the <b>Corpse Crawler</b> will simply wander around until noticing a player. Upon noticing a player, they will be frightened, may pulse the various spikes on their body outward to intimidate the player, and will attempt to path away from the player and break line of sight. When cornered, the <b>Corpse Crawler</b> will also attempt to bite players and deal 20 damage on contact.\n</p><p>Instead of releasing spores, the <b>Corpse Crawler</b> will vomit out a <b>Gore Spike</b> when it feels threatend. This action will deal 20 damage to nearby players. This <b>Gore Spike</b> acts as a hazard for the rest of the day, pulsing the metal spikes lodged in the gore outward roughly every 8 seconds and dealing 20 damage to nearby players.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Spawn_Chances\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Spawn_Chances\">&gt; Spawn Chances</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Corpse Crawler</b> is injected into the <b>Enemy Spawns (Interior)</b> table of any moon experiencing <a href=\"/wiki/Weathers#&gt;_Hallowed\" title=\"Weathers\"><b>Hallowed</b></a> weather with a weight of 28, overriding the current weight if it is lower than that.\n</p><p>The <b>Corpse Crawler</b> also has a chance to spawn on many moons, most commonly spawning within the interior of <a href=\"/wiki/Demetrica\" title=\"Demetrica\"><b>Demetrica</b></a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Moon Name</th>\n<th>Interior or Exterior</th>\n<th>Spawn Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Demetrica\" title=\"Demetrica\">Demetrica</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>9.96%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Desolation\" title=\"Desolation\">Desolation</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>8.13%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Hyx\" title=\"Hyx\">Hyx</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>4.39%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Filitrios\" title=\"Filitrios\">Filitrios</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>2.53%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Oldred\" title=\"Oldred\">Oldred</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>2.21%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Extort\" title=\"Extort\">Extort</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>1.85%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Asteroid-13\" title=\"Asteroid-13\">Asteroid-13</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>1.80%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Descent\" title=\"Descent\">Descent</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>1.14%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Utril\" title=\"Utril\">Utril</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>1.05%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Crowd\" title=\"Crowd\">Crowd</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>1.03%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Junic\" title=\"Junic\">Junic</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>0.68%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Release\" title=\"Release\">Release</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>0.68%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Gloom\" title=\"Gloom\">Gloom</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>0.43%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Narcotic\" title=\"Narcotic\">Narcotic</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>0.37%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Bestiary_Entry\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Bestiary_Entry\">&gt; Bestiary Entry</span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Corpse Crawler <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\">CORPSE CRAWLER<br /><br />Scientific name: Cerec-retoma<br />The Cerec-retoma is a device made up of a hollowed rotting corpse stuffed with machinery using parts of the nervous system as internal wiring to reduce the cost of creation. The body itself seems to serve no other purpose other than to keep the components together. Hence how it has earned the name \u201cCorpse crawler\u201d.<br /><br />It walks around through the means of four hydraulic legs which use various liquids drained from the body among which are spinal fluid and blood rather than water. The extraction happens shortly after the insertion which as a side effect severs the spine and the head from the body in a very short, yet painful method.<br /><br />The body is riddled with spikes protruding through the flesh and skin and can be used as a defensive method against anything that seeks to attack or destroy it.<br /><br />These devices were likely designed and produced by the Trite Control Corporation as the first appearances were sighted on celestial bodies surrounding the fractured remains of the Triton Empire shortly after the creation of the corporation in 2249. There they acted as remotely controlled scouts being able to search and explore through the cameras hidden within the head of the device. The usage of a human body with their organs as components meant that these scouts are purposefully temporary. The rot of the corpse making it near impossible to understand what its original internals may have looked like before deactivation.<br />Later models discovered around 2296 no longer possessed the ability of being remotely controlled but were instead fully autonomous.<br /><br />The corpse crawler bears a striking resemblance to the Areck-hetoma, otherwise known as the Arachnohead which was likely an inspiration for the design.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Audio\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Audio\">&gt; Audio</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Audio\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Action</th>\n<th>Sound\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stepping</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"2\" data-mwtitle=\"CorpseStalkerStep1.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/CorpseStalkerStep1.mp3?3348b3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/CorpseStalkerStep1.mp3/CorpseStalkerStep1.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio><br /><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"2\" data-mwtitle=\"CorpseStalkerStep2.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/CorpseStalkerStep2.mp3?706661\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/CorpseStalkerStep2.mp3/CorpseStalkerStep2.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio><br /><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"2\" data-mwtitle=\"CorpseStalkerStep3.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/CorpseStalkerStep3.mp3?d95a19\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/CorpseStalkerStep3.mp3/CorpseStalkerStep3.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio><br /><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"2\" data-mwtitle=\"CorpseStalkerStep4.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/CorpseStalkerStep4.mp3?850f2b\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/CorpseStalkerStep4.mp3/CorpseStalkerStep4.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Noticing a Player</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"4\" data-mwtitle=\"CorpseStalkerNotice.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/CorpseStalkerNotice.mp3?fedf67\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/CorpseStalkerNotice.mp3/CorpseStalkerNotice.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio><br /><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"4\" data-mwtitle=\"CorpseStalkerNotice2.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/CorpseStalkerNotice2.mp3?3e31cd\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/CorpseStalkerNotice2.mp3/CorpseStalkerNotice2.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Nervous</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"9\" data-mwtitle=\"CorpseStalkerNervous.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/CorpseStalkerNervous.mp3?9b4f5d\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/CorpseStalkerNervous.mp3/CorpseStalkerNervous.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Intimidating</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"2\" data-mwtitle=\"CorpseStalkerStomp.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/CorpseStalkerStomp.mp3?1c8b49\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/CorpseStalkerStomp.mp3/CorpseStalkerStomp.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Attacking</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"1\" data-mwtitle=\"CorpseStalkerAttack.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/CorpseStalkerAttack.mp3?cd2d42\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/CorpseStalkerAttack.mp3/CorpseStalkerAttack.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vomitting</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"2\" data-mwtitle=\"CorpseStalkerVomit.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/CorpseStalkerVomit.mp3?ab3fd9\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/CorpseStalkerVomit.mp3/CorpseStalkerVomit.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Trivia\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Trivia\">&gt; Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>During the unique interior trial on <span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/Release\" title=\"Release\"><b>Release</b></a></span></span>, players end up going through the process of activating a machine to turn an employee into a <b>Corpse Crawler</b>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:CorpseCrawlerTrial.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Corpse Crawler created during the trial.\"><img alt=\"The Corpse Crawler created during the trial.\" src=\"/images/thumb/CorpseCrawlerTrial.jpg/120px-CorpseCrawlerTrial.jpg?271030\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/CorpseCrawlerTrial.jpg/180px-CorpseCrawlerTrial.jpg?271030 1.5x, /images/thumb/CorpseCrawlerTrial.jpg/240px-CorpseCrawlerTrial.jpg?271030 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Corpse Crawler created during the trial.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:GoreSpike1.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A Gore Spike.\"><img alt=\"A Gore Spike.\" src=\"/images/thumb/GoreSpike1.jpg/120px-GoreSpike1.jpg?95734b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/GoreSpike1.jpg/180px-GoreSpike1.jpg?95734b 1.5x, /images/thumb/GoreSpike1.jpg/240px-GoreSpike1.jpg?95734b 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A Gore Spike.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:GoreSpike2.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A Gore Spike pulsing outward.\"><img alt=\"A Gore Spike pulsing outward.\" src=\"/images/thumb/GoreSpike2.jpg/120px-GoreSpike2.jpg?96a85d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/GoreSpike2.jpg/180px-GoreSpike2.jpg?96a85d 1.5x, /images/thumb/GoreSpike2.jpg/240px-GoreSpike2.jpg?96a85d 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A Gore Spike pulsing outward.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n</ul></div></div>", "images": ["CorpseCrawler.jpg", "CorpseCrawlerTrial.jpg", "GoreSpike1.jpg", "GoreSpike2.jpg", "CorpseStalkerStep1.mp3", "CorpseStalkerStep2.mp3", "CorpseStalkerStep3.mp3", "CorpseStalkerStep4.mp3", "CorpseStalkerNotice.mp3", "CorpseStalkerNotice2.mp3", "CorpseStalkerNervous.mp3", "CorpseStalkerStomp.mp3", "CorpseStalkerAttack.mp3", "CorpseStalkerVomit.mp3"], "cats": ["Pages_with_DRUID_infoboxes", "Pages_with_spoilers"]}